urasi oleh administrator Anda."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sebelum memulai"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Parameter laporan (pasien/klien, nomor pemesanan atau nomor registrasi, situs, atau rentang tanggal)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lokasi"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu Utama → Laporan."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Laporan dikelompokkan di bawah menu Laporan: laporan rutin/pasien, statistik agregat, laporan manajemen, dan ekspor data. Sebagian besar laporan membuka formulir kecil tempat Anda memilih cakupan laporan, lalu membuat versi cetak atau file yang dapat diunduh."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Langkah 1: Membuka laporan"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Buka "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Menu Utama ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Main menu", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Kemudian, klik"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Laporan", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reports", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") "}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1439, "alt": "Repor